# Licence

## The anatomy

The anatomical models in `models/head.glb` are derived from **Z-Anatomy**,
which is licensed **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International**
(CC BY-SA 4.0). Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Because CC BY-SA is share-alike, this derivative is published under the same
licence, and so must anything derived from it.

Required attribution, reproduced from Z-Anatomy's own terms:

> "BodyParts3D - The Database Center for Life Science - CC-BY-SA 2.1 Japan"
> "Z-Anatomy - The libre 3D atlas of anatomy - CC-BY-SA 4.0"
> "Cranial Nerves and Foramina - by University of Dundee, CAHID - CC-BY 4.0"

Anatomical definitions in Z-Anatomy derive from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 3.0.

