## The face

The face reconstruction is of a real person and is not covered by either
licence above. It is included with her partner's permission and may not be
reused.

## Third-party models used at runtime

- MediaPipe face landmarker and canonical face model, Google, Apache 2.0
- YuNet face detection and SFace recognition, OpenCV Zoo, Apache 2.0
- three.js, MIT

These are used by the build tools; none of their weights are redistributed
here.
